t outside Chattanooga, Tennessee, United States. Rock City is a unique geological formation described as a citadel of rocks. Visitors can enjoy strolling along the iconic 1,250-metre (4,100 ft) Enchanted Trail that weaves its way past ancient rock formations such as Mushroom Rock, Balance Rock, Fatman''s Squeeze, and the Grand Corridor. Another star feature of Rock City is the over 400 different types of native flowers.\""}, {"source": "unified_sites.description", "url": "unified_sites.description", "quote": "markers []; sha256 4a0144707d8653d70894ea18af089d893eeb4214c1157179f2c42108b65c83c6 (the premise)"}, {"source": "ancient-nerds-map/src/components/SitePopup/sections/DescriptionSection.tsx", "url": "ancient-nerds-map/src/components/SitePopup/sections/DescriptionSection.tsx", "quote": "citationSources: every entry becomes a source link with its [n], whether or not a marker of the text cites it"}]'::jsonb),
